  #line-at(85.08pt, 463.898pt, "electricity into heat with certain efficiency. The power generators, storage units and demand are ")
  #line-at(85.069pt, 482.854pt, "attached to the electrical power bus. The wind and solar generators are defined by a CF, which is ")
  #line-at(85.058pt, 501.81pt, "a value between 0 and 1, representing the energy that can be potentially generated over an hour ")
  #line-at(85.08pt, 520.765pt, "by each generator normalized to its nominal power capacity. An Open Cycle Gas Turbine (OCGT) ")
  #line-at(85.08pt, 539.721pt, "generator is included to represent other existing backup technologies simplifying the energy ")
  #line-at(85.08pt, 558.677pt, "system. It is worth noting that, if the CO")
