  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(262.44pt, 558.72pt, " emissions were not constrained to 5% of the 1990 values ")
  #line-at(85.093pt, 577.676pt, "for each country, OCGT would become the predominant technology to balance variable ")
  #line-at(85.093pt, 596.631pt, "renewable energy fluctuations displacing energy storage systems.  ")
  #line-at(85.093pt, 627.588pt, "There are two types of electrical storage systems: Li-ion batteries, and PHPS. In addition to ")
  #line-at(85.104pt, 646.665pt, "charging and discharging into the electrical power grid, the waste heat generated at the H2P ")
  #line-at(85.104pt, 665.62pt, "converter during the PHPS discharge is directed to the heating bus. In different scenarios, one of ")
  #line-at(85.104pt, 684.576pt, "the two types of low-temperature energy storage systems is considered: CTES and ITES. The ")
